ainer gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">NIELIT CCC Examination 2026 : Exam Details</h6>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0NIELIT CCC May Examination 2026 : Conducted By\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">The National Institute of Electronics and Information Technology (NIELIT), under the Ministry of Electronics and Information Technology, Government of India, conducts the CCC exam.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Check &amp; Download NIELIT CCC May Exam 2026 Admit Card\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Follow the steps below to access your NIELIT CCC June Exam Admit Card:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Visit the Official Website</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to the official NIELIT portal: <a rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\">https://student.nielit.gov.in</a>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Go to the Admit Card Section</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on the \u201cDownload Admit Card\u201d link under the \u201cStudent Zone\u201d or relevant section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Select the Exam</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Choose \u201cCCC\u201d from the list of available courses.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Enter Your Details</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Provide your application number and date of birth as required.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Fill in the security captcha code correctly.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Download the Admit Card</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the \u201cSubmit\u201d button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your admit card will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Print the Admit Card</strong>:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Review the details carefully.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download and print the admit card for future use.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"d62f692b8ea998b59e21c86a-text/javascript\"></script>\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n<ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-9762662687323163\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"7596594071\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" style=\"display:block\"></ins>\n<script type=\"d62f692b8ea998b59e21c86a-text/javascript\">\n     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});\n</script>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download May Admit Card</